  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-metadata-standards-checker.\n\n- Parses and checks ISO 19115 and FGDC XML geospatial metadata for compliance.\n- Validates required fields, controlled vocabularies, and consistency rules.\n- Calculates a completeness score and produces an error/warning issue list per file.\n- Supports auto-detection of metadata standard.\n- Includes a --synthetic mode to generate full or incomplete sample metadata for demo/testing.\n- All processing is performed offline; no data uploaded.\n- Outputs reports in JSON and (if synthetic mode) example XML files.",
